mcp-mgba
Copyright the mcp-mgba contributors

This package bundles a compiled build of libmgba, mGBA's core emulation
library, in the form of a small shared library (`libmcbamgba_shim.so` /
`libmcbamgba_shim.dylib`) that statically links libmgba and exposes a thin,
flat C API around it (see `native/shim.c` / `native/shim.h` in this
project's source repository). Nothing in that shim or its libmgba
dependency is modified for behavior beyond enabling a headless,
Qt/SDL/X11-free build (LIBMGBA_ONLY, BUILD_SHARED) and one narrow build-time
patch working around libmgba's CMake forcing a static-only build under that
mode (`native/patches/0001-libmgba-only-shared.patch`).

